     "body": "<p>Success!</p>\n\n<p>Steps: <br/>\n1. a Fedora with LevelDB, create two containers and one binary<br/>\n2. backup: curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/fcr:backup\"<br/>\n3. a new Fedora server with MySQL, verify table ispn is created<br/>\n4. restore: curl -X POST --data-binary \"/home/ubuntu/1455291318495-0\" \"http://localhost:8080/fcrepo4/rest/fcr:restore\"<br/>\n5. Verify containers and binary file. </p>",
