  "description": "<p>Migrate backup dump from LevelDB to a Fedora repo with MySQL.</p>\n\n<p>Steps:<br/>\n1. Create backup dump from a Fedora with LevelDB<br/>\n2. Create a Fedora with MySQL<br/>\n3. Restore backup to that Fedora with MySQL<br/>\n4. Verify the data consistency with these two Fedora servers.</p>",
